{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36571","headline":"往年进士赵能卿尝话金庭胜事见示叙 · 罗隐","name":"往年进士赵能卿尝话金庭胜事见示叙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"会稽诗客赵能卿，往岁相逢话石城。\n正恨故人无上寿，喜闻良宰有高情。\n山朝佐命层层耸，水接飞流步步清。\n两火一刀罹乱後，会须乘兴雪中行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36571.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36571","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}